    "title": "Requirements and estimates",
    "body": "A public API has 1 million API keys and 20 servers, with up to 50,000 requests per second at peak. Requirements: (F1) each key may make **100 requests per minute** and send up to **20 at once** after a quiet time; (F2) refused requests get 429 with Retry-After; (N1) the limiter adds at most 2 ms; (N2) the limit holds however requests are spread. Estimates: one check per request, **50,000 store calls per second**; about 100 bytes per key, **100 MB** for a million keys.",
