    "title": "Counting by the minute",
    "body": "The simplest rule is a **fixed window**: one counter per key per minute, reset at the top of each minute. But a client can send 100 requests at 0:59.9 and 100 more at 1:00.0: **200 requests within about a second**, twice the limit. If the promise is \"at most 100 in any minute\", a fixed window breaks it at every window edge.",
