  {
    "title": "A bucket of tokens",
    "body": "A **token bucket** gives each key a bucket with room for **20 tokens** that refills at 100 per minute, about 1.67 per second. Each request takes a token; an empty bucket means 429. After a quiet time the bucket is full, so up to 20 requests pass at once, and after that about 1.67 per second. It needs only two numbers per key: tokens left and the last refill time.",
