  {
    "title": "Summary",
    "body": "Each requirement and how it is met: bursts of 20 and 100 per minute by the **token bucket**; 429 with Retry-After for refused requests; exact limits however requests spread by a **global, atomic** count in the shared store; at most 2 ms by one 1 ms call; 50,000 checks per second at half a store node; store outages by **failing open to per-node limits**, with the reason that refusing everyone would be worse for a general API.",
